                            Credit
                        </div>
                        <h5 class="cmp-insights-promo-grid__featured-title">
                            <a tabindex="-1" href="/insights-news/insights/2026/06/intel-scale-flexibility-and-partnership-in-action" target="_self" data-title="Intel: Scale, Flexibility and Partnership in Action " data-analytics-link="apollo-insights-promo-grid-featured-card">
                                Intel: Scale, Flexibility and Partnership in Action 
                            </a>
                        </h5>
                    </div>
                    <div class="cmp-insights-promo-grid__featured-desc">
                        Apollo provided a scaled, flexible capital solution at a pivotal moment for Intel, a leading semiconductor manufacturer, providing financial flexibility and a results-driven partnership.</div>
                    <div class="cmp-insights-promo-grid__featured-cta">
                        <acl-apollo-button type="secondary" variant="filled" color="black" href="/insights-news/insights/2026/06/intel-scale-flexibility-and-partnership-in-action" target="_self" label="Learn More" title="Intel: Scale, Flexibility and Partnership in Action " analyticsId="apollo-insights-promo-grid-featured-card">
