                            <div class="cmp-insights-promo-grid__card-header">
                                <div class="cmp-insights-promo-grid__card-tag">Equity</div>
                                <div class="cmp-insights-promo-grid__card-title">Panasonic Automotive: Partnership in Motion</div>
                                <div class="cmp-insights-promo-grid__card-desc">Apollo’s 2024 carve-out of Panasonic Automotive Systems shows how operational partnership can reposition a world-class business for long-term global competitiveness.</div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="cmp-insights-promo-grid__card-footer">
